    <string name="prog_guide_menu_ambient">Instant ambient mode (Pro)</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_menu_help">See this guide again</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_controls_notification">The same controls show up in the notification.</string>

    <string name="prog_guide_shelf_title">Shelf, ambient mode and floating window</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_shelf_body">The shelf holds the glassware for your whole plan: each vessel fills up when you finish its session. Dashed ones are skipped sessions.</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_ambient">Ambient mode (Pro): if you don\'t touch the screen (or tap 🌙 in the menu), only the vessel, the time and what\'s next stay, dimmed. Tap to come back.</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_floating">If you leave the app, the timer keeps going in a floating window and in the notification.</string>

    <string name="prog_guide_elements_title">Collect the periodic table</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_elements_body1">Your focus time turns into elements: every 25 min completed earns you a basic one, and every 60 min a rare one. Skipped sessions don\'t count.</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_elements_body2">In ★ Achievements › Synthesizer, fuse two elements: their atomic numbers add up (H 1 + U 92 → Np 93). It\'s the only way to get the synthetic ones.</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_elements_body3">Your elements fill the work vessels and behave like the real thing: sodium fizzes, neon glows, mercury shines like metal. Tap one in the table to learn what it is and what it\'s used for.</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_sound">Sound (Pro): white, pink or brown noise, rain or waves while you work.</string>

    <string name="prog_guide_progress_title">Mastery, medals and leagues</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_mastery_body">Duplicates aren\'t wasted: every time you get an element, its mastery goes up, from bronze to silver to gold (5, 10 and 15 times; 2, 4 and 6 for synthetic ones). If the whole table reaches a level, we celebrate.</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_medals_body">Your medals live in Progress: streaks, focus hours, early mornings, fusions and more. The ones you\'re missing look faded, with a ring that shows how far along you are.</string>
    <string name="prog_guide_league_body">In ★ Achievements › League you compete each week with up to 30 people: your points are your focus minutes. The top ones move up a league and the bottom ones move down, from Hydrogen to Platinum. You need to sign in to your account.</string>
